WEBVTT

00:00:07.726 --> 00:00:09.603
[sniffs]

00:00:10.768 --> 00:00:11.803
Mmm.

00:00:11.901 --> 00:00:14.741
Oh, you got to try this.

00:00:20.921 --> 00:00:23.921
Okay. He is exactly
the Sonic you once knew.

00:00:26.242 --> 00:00:27.242
Uh-huh.
Uh-huh.

00:00:35.781 --> 00:00:37.781
Sonic!
Whoa!

00:00:39.321 --> 00:00:40.321
Bring it in, bud.

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:44.081
It's good to be back
in blue.

00:00:44.401 --> 00:00:47.661
The golden god thing was fun,
but blue has always been
more my color.

00:00:47.841 --> 00:00:48.841
Looks good on you.

00:00:49.062 --> 00:00:51.742
Sonic, you were
the most powerful hero

00:00:51.742 --> 00:00:54.222
in the universe,
and you let it go.

00:00:54.781 --> 00:00:55.781
Why?

00:00:58.042 --> 00:01:00.242
Because I still have
some growing up to do.

00:01:02.372 --> 00:01:04.472
And I kind of like
being a kid.

00:01:04.892 --> 00:01:06.151
And you're not
just any kid.

00:01:07.051 --> 00:01:08.051
You're our kid.

00:01:08.932 --> 00:01:09.932
That's right.

00:01:10.043 --> 00:01:12.780
Bring it in!
[Tails] Yay. Hugs.

00:01:12.892 --> 00:01:15.791
It's a good thing
we didn't do this before.
You would've blown up.

00:01:23.952 --> 00:01:25.392
[Sonic] Whoa! You fixed it.

00:01:25.572 --> 00:01:28.692
I've spent my whole life
questing for this.

00:01:29.012 --> 00:01:30.032
Now I have it.

00:01:30.412 --> 00:01:31.672
Now we have it.

00:01:32.211 --> 00:01:34.492
What do we do with it?
What next?

00:01:34.751 --> 00:01:36.791
There were once
two orders of heroes

00:01:36.791 --> 00:01:40.892
who protected the galaxy
from those who would use
the Emerald for evil.

00:01:41.392 --> 00:01:45.011
But they have all passed on
to the great battleground
in the sky.

00:01:45.331 --> 00:01:48.291
So we start a new order.
The three of us.

00:01:48.732 --> 00:01:50.212
This is no light task.

00:01:50.212 --> 00:01:55.252
We must make a vow
to use our powers
to keep the universe safe,

00:01:55.992 --> 00:01:57.432
to watch out for each other.

00:01:58.192 --> 00:01:59.432
Our new tribe.

00:01:59.792 --> 00:02:00.792
Oh, I know!

00:02:00.832 --> 00:02:01.832
A power bump!

00:02:02.132 --> 00:02:03.132
Good idea.

00:02:04.011 --> 00:02:07.371
It's an Earth custom.
An unbreakable promise.

00:02:08.131 --> 00:02:09.131
Very well.

00:02:09.972 --> 00:02:11.992
A power bump it is.

00:02:13.153 --> 00:02:15.275
Power bump!

00:02:19.482 --> 00:02:21.342
[Sonic over PA]
It's truly a beautiful day

00:02:21.342 --> 00:02:23.342
for baseball here
in Green Hills.

00:02:23.622 --> 00:02:25.282
An exciting lineup today

00:02:25.422 --> 00:02:28.482
with the debut appearance
of two new players!

00:02:28.862 --> 00:02:32.682
On the mound,
rookie sensation
from across the galaxy,

00:02:33.222 --> 00:02:34.942
Miles "Tails" Prower,

00:02:35.862 --> 00:02:39.522
facing off against
the powerhouse,
Knuckles the Echidna.

00:02:40.881 --> 00:02:43.001
Um, I don't understand.

00:02:43.722 --> 00:02:45.742
Why am I angry
at the enemy ball?

00:02:46.022 --> 00:02:47.022
You're not angry.

00:02:47.022 --> 00:02:49.202
You just want to hit it
as hard as you can

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:50.482
and then run around the bases.

00:02:50.842 --> 00:02:53.622
But if my quest ends
where I am standing,

00:02:53.942 --> 00:02:55.082
why run at all?

00:02:55.782 --> 00:02:58.362
Ugh. I can't with this guy.
Why do I even try?

00:02:58.582 --> 00:03:01.341
This is just a game.
We're out here having fun.

00:03:01.442 --> 00:03:02.442
Just having some fun.

00:03:02.559 --> 00:03:05.278
Fun. Huh.

00:03:05.394 --> 00:03:08.035
All right!
Give him the heat, Tails!

00:03:08.152 --> 00:03:09.871
Hope you're ready
for my fastball.

00:03:10.051 --> 00:03:12.291
Your fastball
will be dishonored.

00:03:12.711 --> 00:03:13.932
And so will you, fox.
[grunts]

00:03:15.131 --> 00:03:16.131
Easy, guys!

00:03:16.412 --> 00:03:17.412
Don't think about it too much.

00:03:17.452 --> 00:03:19.492
Just keep your elbow up,
eye on the ball

00:03:19.592 --> 00:03:20.592
and give it a ride.

00:03:20.812 --> 00:03:22.312
A ride? To where?

00:03:23.072 --> 00:03:24.215
[grunts]

00:03:24.328 --> 00:03:25.850
[growls]

00:03:26.764 --> 00:03:28.401
Power bump!

00:03:30.799 --> 00:03:32.436
[screams]

00:03:33.122 --> 00:03:34.421
Ha! Victory is mine!

00:03:34.642 --> 00:03:36.982
Hey, no fair!
That shouldn't count.

00:03:37.001 --> 00:03:39.341
First base
is also mine!

00:03:39.961 --> 00:03:41.211
I think that was
our only ball.
[laughs]

00:03:41.211 --> 00:03:43.822
I have conquered
the second of the bases!

00:03:44.342 --> 00:03:45.862
Who wants ice cream?

00:03:45.982 --> 00:03:47.415
Knocked the cover off that.

00:03:47.535 --> 00:03:50.243
Ice cream!
Ice cream, yeah!

00:03:50.362 --> 00:03:53.562
[laughing]
I am having the fun!
What is ice cream?

00:03:53.961 --> 00:03:57.161
It's a dessert.
If you like fun,
you're gonna love it.

00:03:57.482 --> 00:04:00.341
Oh, yum. Dessert.
Does it have grapes in it?

00:04:00.682 --> 00:04:01.961
No, not usually.

00:04:02.382 --> 00:04:03.722
I'm proud of
our little guy.

00:04:04.522 --> 00:04:07.782
I really like
his new friends,
especially the red one.

00:04:08.161 --> 00:04:10.982
He cracks me up.
Heck of a swing too.

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:12.072
Come on, fox.

00:04:12.161 --> 00:04:13.782
Our dessert adventure
awaits.
Whoo!

00:04:14.001 --> 00:04:15.001
Good job,
guys.
Yeah.

00:04:15.121 --> 00:04:16.402
You too, baby.

00:04:16.621 --> 00:04:18.041
Let's go get some ice cream.
Come on, come on.

00:04:19.801 --> 00:04:21.201
I'm happy for you, pal.

00:04:22.022 --> 00:04:23.022
Got your wingmen.

00:04:23.581 --> 00:04:25.062
Perfect friends
to grow up with.

00:04:25.322 --> 00:04:28.062
Come on, Knuckles.
Ah!
My victory chariot!

00:04:30.272 --> 00:04:33.352
I've got a lot more
than that... Dad.

00:04:38.671 --> 00:04:39.932
Race you to the truck.

00:04:41.791 --> 00:04:42.791
One, two, three, go!

00:04:43.911 --> 00:04:45.772
No, don't go easy on me.
I want your best.

00:04:46.312 --> 00:04:48.991
Sonic, I have just been told
they have sprinkles.

00:04:49.432 --> 00:04:52.491
Ice cream and sprinkles?
This is your new destiny.

00:04:53.291 --> 00:04:58.071
What a perfect meal
to celebrate my victory
over you in base of ball.

00:04:58.211 --> 00:05:00.551
What?
I mean,
you barely beat me.

00:05:00.732 --> 00:05:03.291
Ha! You've never been
beaten so hard.

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:06.321
[Sonic laughs]

00:05:07.972 --> 00:05:09.211
Can't forget this.

00:05:10.563 --> 00:05:12.471
