00:05:27.806 --> 00:05:31.483
♪ And we take it to places
That we only dreamed♪

00:05:31.588 --> 00:05:33.565
♪ I think I'm home♪

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:35.404
♪ This is my heaven, baby♪

00:05:35.508 --> 00:05:41.268
