00:05:45.432 --> 00:05:48.935
♪ Happy we lovin'
We lovin' our lives♪

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:52.509
♪ Things I wished to see
Seem to come to be♪

00:05:52.612 --> 00:05:55.354
♪ I seek the truth, I'm honest
Hey♪

00:05:55.458 --> 00:05:58.546
