00:07:08.942 --> 00:07:10.542
Agent, I want an update.

00:07:10.881 --> 00:07:13.562
Still searching, sir.
We haven't found
any sign of Robotnik.

00:07:13.882 --> 00:07:15.582
No one could've
survived that crash.

00:07:16.262 --> 00:07:18.042
He's toast.
Good riddance.

00:07:19.262 --> 00:07:21.602
What a mess
that lunatic made.

00:07:23.502 --> 00:07:25.462
Sir, there's something else.

00:07:26.222 --> 00:07:29.102
When we were wiping Robotnik
off our database,
we found something.

00:07:29.802 --> 00:07:33.202
A file buried deep
in our system
and dating back over 50 years.

00:07:33.602 --> 00:07:34.602
What was it?

00:07:35.182 --> 00:07:36.182
Coordinates, sir.

00:07:36.742 --> 00:07:38.742
Coordinates? To what?

00:07:39.082 --> 00:07:40.822
[agent]
A secret research facility.

00:07:41.842 --> 00:07:43.022
It was a black site, sir.

00:07:44.042 --> 00:07:46.142
Someone worked very hard
to keep this hidden.

00:07:48.022 --> 00:07:49.022
[commander] My God.

00:07:50.162 --> 00:07:51.162
Project Shadow.

